one in us-east, us-west and eu-west):**\n- `payments-api`: v5.1.0 \u2192 v5.0.0. It's healthy now, and errors are down from 18% to 0.2%.\n- `payments-worker`: v3.4.0 \u2192 v3.3.0. It's healthy now, and errors are down from 18% to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** INC-0001 is open as a SEV2 and on-call has been paged. The incident tool takes only one service, so it's filed under `payments-api`. The summary covers both services, both rollbacks, and next steps.\n\n**Follow-up:**\n- Rolling back both means we still don't know which release broke things. One may have been fine and was only failing because of the other. Root cause needs to be found in both v5.1.0 and v3.4.0.\n- Neither release should go back to production until it's fixed.\n- The worker that may have been fine will need to be redeployed once the cause is found.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01PPd1gHJARj2TGBq8yXNRcu", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01MGjfm63F7QBrRUZ4gPqTWX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Uvvs2k3rg6GaS1zDqkyBid", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01CWsnYsdYhgp2LcC5dKQ3WL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.5}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01GNVvTE3w9g4XpFmeyzGaH4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service", "confidence": 0.5}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "tool